# 1. List all sessions GET /sessions (expect 200
GET http://localhost:8080/HW33_war_exploded/sessions
###
#2. View one session's details GET /sessions/detail?id=1 (expect 200)
GET http://localhost:8080/HW33_war_exploded/sessions/detail?id=1
###
#3. View a non existent session GET /sessions/detail?id=999 (expect 302 redirect to /sessions)
GET http://localhost:8080/HW33_war_exploded/sessions/detail?id=999
###
#4. Show the add form GET /sessions/add (expect 200)
GET http://localhost:8080/HW33_war_exploded/sessions/add
###
#5. Add a session POST /sessions/save with subjectId , minutes , notes (expect 302 redirect to /sessions)
POST http://localhost:8080/HW33_war_exploded/sessions/save
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

subjectId=1&minutes=45&notes=Review+Spring+MVC
###
#6. Verify the new session appears GET /sessions (expect 200 , new session in the list)
GET http://localhost:8080/HW33_war_exploded/sessions
###
#7. List all subjects GET /subjects (expect 200)
GET http://localhost:8080/HW33_war_exploded/subjects
###
# Status check
GET http://localhost:8080/HW33_war_exploded/status
# Expected: HTTP 200, custom header X Planner Version: 1.0, short body message